{
  "id": "c1-e48-global-cooperation",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Global cooperation",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how connected do you feel to people in other countries?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, have you ever worked on a project with people from another country?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, which global problems concern you most?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how much do you follow international news?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e48-a1",
            "c1-e48-a2",
            "c1-e48-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people working across borders. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might be trying to achieve, and what obstacles they could face.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these examples of cooperation do you think is most important?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e48-b1",
            "c1-e48-b2",
            "c1-e48-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show responses to global challenges. Choose two of the pictures and say why cooperation might be necessary here, and what might stop it from working.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, can countries really be expected to put global needs before their own?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some global challenges, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9000
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e48-global-cooperation",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How important is it for countries to work together on these challenges?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7500
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e48-global-cooperation",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which one most urgently needs international action?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about international cooperation.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Why do you think it is so difficult for countries to agree on how to solve global problems?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should wealthy countries give financial aid to poorer ones?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, are international organisations effective?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Could technology make international cooperation easier?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should individual countries lose some independence for the sake of global agreements?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, is the idea of world citizenship realistic?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e48-global-cooperation/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
